      <documentation>Adds customer self-service through an authenticated or tokenised preference portal. Same logical skeleton as Phase 1 plus a customer surface, token issuance and a token and audit holding.</documentation>
    </element>
  </folder>
  <purpose>Level 1 logical views for the consent and preference management interim transition. Two options: Phase 1 (API-only, no customer-facing UI) and Phase 2 (Sitecore-hosted preference center with self-service). Derived from CX_Hub_C_P_Interim_Transition_Options.pdf, 3 August 2026.</purpose>
</archimate:model>
